  <running_head>IMPERSONALIUM.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <signature>P 5</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">sine casu: aut constructionem persona-</l>
    <l n="2">lium imitantur, ut:</l>
    <l n="3">1. παντα ἐστιν ἐξευρεῖν.</l>
    <l n="4">λεῖ χρημάτων.</l>
    <l n="5">2. λεῖ μοι εἰρωνίης.</l>
    <l n="6">ἡσυχίαν ἔχειν, ὑμῖν ἀντέχῃ.</l>
    <l n="7">μεταμέλει τῇ πόλει τῶν πεπραγμένων.</l>
    <l n="8">μέπεσί μοι τότε.</l>
    <l n="9">ποὶ τὴν Διαφέρει;</l>
    <l n="10" type="heading" level="1" para="true">DE SYNTAXI PARTI-</l>
    <l n="11" type="heading" level="1">CIPIORUM.</l>
    <l n="12" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Regula Convenientia Partici-</l>
    <l n="13" type="heading" level="2">piorum.</l>
    <l n="14" type="heading" level="3" para="true">I.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Participium positum inter duo Sub-</l>
    <l n="16">stantiva diversorum Numerorum aut</l>
    <l n="17">Generum, priori respondet, ut:</l>
    <l n="18">Ἰωσὴφ τῷ πατρὶ ἀφορμὴν ξυμφορίας ὑπάρχων.</l>
    <l n="19">Ἀμφίπολις πάλαι ἐννέα ὁδοὶ καλυμμένη</l>
    <l n="20">καταφρονεῖσιν ἡμῶν, ὡς μηδὲν ὄντων.</l>
    <l n="21" type="heading" level="3" para="true">II.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Duo Genitivi absolutè sine Verbo</l>
    <l n="23">junguntur, designantes consequentiam:</l>
  </main_text>
